          "statement": "portabletent_item公共构造带portableitem并SetPristine，非master返回；master安装finiteuses/inventoryitem/deployable，OnDeploy是自定义file-local消费者，未安装stackable、complexprojectile或keep_in_inventory_on_deploy。restrictedtag赋值处为注释。独立导出portabletent_item_placer。普通DEPLOY依DC-C01/02/03的移交分支将本次对象交给消费者。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "DEP-S02",
