        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-DEPLOY-001-C02",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "portabletent_item默认使用inventoryitem的prefab后缀placer名与DEFAULT地面测试。PlayerController为活动物/手柄光标物创建预览，绑定replica CanDeploy；POINT菜单也调用replica。鼠标提交发送动作/点/旋转，master OnRemoteRightClick重选同code/mod动作；手柄部署重建需GrandOwner为玩家。两端普通DEPLOY映射doshortaction，client执行preview，server在第6帧PerformBufferedAction。取消预览删除placer，服务器短动作提前退出按缓冲身份及lastheldaction条件清理。",
