        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-DEPLOY-001-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "portabletent的OnDismantle与未烧毁OnHammered共用ChangeToItem。它先RemoveComponent sleepingbag/portablestructure/workable，再加NOCLICK、播放disassemble并注册animover。OnAnimOver仅在AnimDone且当前动画为disassemble时读取结构uses，ReplacePrefab为portabletent_item，再写uses及idle_item。ReplacePrefab只Spawn、定位、删除原实体、返回新实体，没有复制旧组件数据，也未对nil产物设guard。回调只显式转移uses，未声明完整状态迁移。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "DEP-S03",
            "DEP-S05",
            "DEP-S24",
            "DEP-S26"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-DEPLOY-001-C06",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "HAMMER的OnHit会唤醒当前sleeper；sleepingbag卸载hook也调用DoWakeUp。唤醒清双方关联并调用portabletent OnWake，后者解绑onignite、停止sleep_tasks并Use一次。finiteuses到零OnFinished停声、播destroy、animover删除且persists=false。烧毁OnBurnt调用DefaultBurntStructureFn后移除碰撞和portablestructure，烧毁后的锤击改走掉落/FX/Remove。此处只绑定portabletent消费者及已列hook，完整燃烧助手内部仍须另外核查。",
