        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-DEPLOY-001-C07",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "两形态构造均初始化finiteuses最大值和当前值。finiteuses OnSave只在非满或doesnotstartfull时返回uses，OnLoad有uses键才SetUses；GetPersistData汇总仍存在的组件payload。portabletent prefab OnSave仅记录燃烧/烧毁布尔，OnLoad仅据burnt调用burnable.onburnt。ChangeToItem未置persists=false，也未安装保存过渡标志的回调。",
